Persistence of Vision Raytracer POV-Ray 2.0 Catalog file.   

Here are the contents of the POVSCN archive.
It contains sub-directories full of sample scene files for use
with POV-Ray 2.0.

Note that the standard include files and simpler demo files
are now included in the POVDOC archive.

Each directory has a .CAT file describing the files it contains.  

POVSCN.CAT          This catalog file.
POVLEGAL.DOC        Important legal information
POVINF.DOC          Where to obtaing POV-Ray files
WHATSNEW.DOC        New feature list

LEVEL1\*.*          Beginner level sample scenes
LEVEL2\*.*          Intermediate level sample scenes
LEVEL3\*.*          Advanced level sample scenes
MATH\*.*            Complicated quartic, cubic & poly demos

